      "Two unrelated jobs run at12:00with different request IDs. What does a time-only join risk?|False correlation|Guaranteed deduplication~Similar time does not make different jobs duplicate events.|Automatic authentication~Temporal proximity does not prove identity.|Elimination of late events~A join does not prevent collection delay.|A time-only join can merge unrelated interactions whose occurrence happens to be close.",
